          "why_rejected": "A participant's age at the time of study assessment was not located in the instrument. Searches returned low confidence results with no usable match.",
          "exposes_the_estimate_to": "Time-based confounding: older women at assessment are more likely to have had hysterectomy earlier and are also at higher baseline risk for arrhythmia; unmeasured confounding from assessment time could bias results."
